Hello fellow nethackers,


this is my first post to the group, but I have been a long-time
Nethack addict. I'm not very good at it (ascended exactly once), but
anyway...

Recently, something most unusual happened to me. I was at mine's end,
just finished digging for the jewels, when I suddenly faced a pit
fiend. Ooops, I thought, maybe someone stepped onto a polymorph trap.
I had no proper means of escape, so I got beaten down. As a last
resort, I sent a prayer up to Anhur who seemed to have been very well-
pleased, as among the usual "pulls back" lines there was the message
"the lichen drops a bow". And there it was, the demon converted to the
wimpiest of the wimpy.

A question to all the source divers out there? Is there really a
chance that during prayer your enemy is polymorphed? I can only think
of one other possible explanation: A gnome with a bow polymorphed into
a chameleon that changed from incorporating a pit fiend into a lichen
right in this very moment.

